# Index regularly

Run when you finish a turn that changed records, Go sources, or docs under `docs/decisions/` or `docs/global-decisions/`.

```bash
archivist index --plain
archivist embed --worker --once   # when Ollama is available
archivist export
```

- Index does not require Ollama
- Skip if you only touched `docs/archive/` or `.archivist/`
- If Ollama is down, index and export anyway; skip embed
